{"type":"standard","title":"Northern Ndebele language","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Northern Ndebele language</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q35613","titles":{"canonical":"Northern_Ndebele_language","normalized":"Northern Ndebele language","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Northern Ndebele language</span></span>"},"pageid":1876853,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Sindebele-dict.jpg/330px-Sindebele-dict.jpg","width":330,"height":513},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/75/Sindebele-dict.jpg","width":450,"height":699},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1354792827","tid":"5201a71c-528a-11f1-8600-fb392e9f4786","timestamp":"2026-05-18T07:22:26Z","description":"Bantu language of Zimbabwe and Botswana","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Northern_Ndebele_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Northern_Ndebele_language?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Northern_Ndebele_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Northern_Ndebele_language"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Northern_Ndebele_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Northern_Ndebele_language","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Northern_Ndebele_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Northern_Ndebele_language"}},"extract":"Northern Ndebele, also called Ndebele, isiNdebele saseNyakatho, Zimbabwean Ndebele, isiNdebele or North Ndebele, associated with the term Matabele, is a Nguni language spoken by the Northern Ndebele people which belongs to the Nguni group of languages.","extract_html":"<p><b>Northern Ndebele</b>, also called <b>Ndebele</b>, <b>isiNdebele saseNyakatho</b>, <b>Zimbabwean Ndebele</b>, <b>isiNdebele</b> or <b>North Ndebele</b>, associated with the term <b>Matabele</b>, is a Nguni language spoken by the Northern Ndebele people which belongs to the Nguni group of languages.</p>"}